# Every tool is published as of v5 — a deliberate decision, see CHANGELOG.
#
# The hiding mechanism is still in place and unused. To pull a tool back off
# the public site: add its path here, run `git rm --cached <path>`, and mark
# it `data-private` in tools.html (plus a trailing `,1` on its fact row in
# index.html). Counts, categories and the text index all re-derive themselves.
#
# NOTE: adding a line here does NOT untrack an already-committed file.

# Local version archive — snapshots duplicate ~1.8MB each.
versions/

.DS_Store
